<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 101 0 R
/E (Model United Nations, commonly known as MUN, is an academic simulation of the United Nations in which students assume the roles of representatives of different countries. Delegates participate in committees where they discuss international issues, negotiate with other countries, formulate solutions, and work toward the creation of resolutions.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
